# Production build settings. Everything runs on Azure:
#   data and files  -> the Function App behind /api (Azure PostgreSQL, Blob Storage)
#   sign-in         -> Microsoft Entra ID
# No Supabase or Netlify setting belongs here any more. Without
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL the app has no way to reach Supabase even by accident.

# The cutover switches.
VITE_API_BASE=/api
VITE_BLOB_STORAGE=on

# Sign-in with Microsoft Entra ID: app registration "TechZoid CRM" in the
# company's own Microsoft 365 directory (techzoidtechnologies.com), where
# every member of staff has an account and two-step verification. Moved
# there in October 2026 from the ttpldelhi directory, where staff were
# guests and were asked to set up verification a second time — which
# Microsoft then blocked as "suspicious activity".
# None of these are secrets: a client id, a tenant id and a scope are all
# public by design and already visible to anyone who opens the sign-in page.
# Sign-in is Microsoft only; there is no other sign-in to fall back to.
VITE_AUTH=entra
VITE_ENTRA_CLIENT_ID=10c2125e-5080-4019-be51-108b85a3a3bf
VITE_ENTRA_TENANT_ID=7fbedec0-0c39-4028-b5af-5f73a3d65e64
VITE_ENTRA_API_SCOPE=api://10c2125e-5080-4019-be51-108b85a3a3bf/access_as_user
